<title>BELGIUM: EU clears John Deere/ Lombard deal - EU source.</title>
<headline>EU clears John Deere/ Lombard deal - EU source.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission has cleared a deal by which John Deere Capital Corporation, controlled by Deere &amp; Company of the U.S., and Lombard North Central Plc share control in John Deere Credit Ltd, a European Union source said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>Lombard North Central is a subsidiary of National Westminster Bank Plc. John Deere Capital Corp makes and distributes farm equipment and other machinery.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom +32 2 287 68 11</p>
</text>
